title: Fake popup window around a framed sign-in
severity: high
score: 55
tags: phishing, bitb, aitm
attack: T1566.002, T1036, T1656
description: A non-brand page draws a brand's URL (onedrive.office.com/...,
  login.microsoftonline.com/...) as bare text, a fake address bar, right above an iframe
  the brand does not serve: an in-page popup that frames the kit's own page or its proxy
  of the real login. Fires before any password field loads.
---
// See fake_window_frames in _shared.kql.
fake_window_frames
